msgid "Why can the AI not connect to my site?"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:420
msgid "Usually loopback routing on the host or a local server setup. Open About & Info and run the REST API loopback test to see whether your server can reach its own endpoints."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:424
msgid "Do I need Node.js?"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:425
msgid "Only for Claude Desktop, which reaches this site through the mcp-remote connector. Cursor and other HTTP-capable clients connect to the endpoint directly."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:429
msgid "Can I use it with VS Code or other editors?"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:430
msgid "Yes. Any client that speaks the Model Context Protocol — including VS Code extensions such as Roo Code or Cline — can load this plugin using the endpoint on the Client setup tab."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:434
msgid "Does the plugin send my data anywhere?"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:435
msgid "No. My Site Hand runs entirely on your WordPress host. Your content, logs, products, and configuration go only to the clients you connect, on the calls they make."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:439
msgid "A call came back as 429. What now?"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:440
msgid "The token hit its hourly or daily cap. Raise the limits under Settings → Limits, or wait for the window to roll over. Throttled calls are written to the audit log too."
